{
  "name": "unknown-transition-turn",
  "purpose": "Exactly two events open a turn: an acceptance, and an activity-caused running transition bearing a turn the stream has not introduced. A session-caused transition reports the foreground moving for a reason the host did not cause, which is never a reason to invent an owner for it, so its turn must already be open and a fresh one is refused.",
